  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $G_n$ be the unit distance graph in $\\mathbb{R}^n$, with two vertices joined by an edge if and only if the distance between them is $1$.\nEstimate the chromatic number $\\chi(G_n)$. Does it grow exponentially in $n$? Does $ \\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\chi(G_n)^{1/n} $ exist?",
